Next-generation financial dashboard and mobile app with zero-latency multi-currency settlement, card management, and automated expense insights.

## Trust as a Design Material

Fintech lives or dies on trust. Every screen had to communicate state unambiguously — pending, settled, failed — while keeping the visual noise of traditional banking dashboards out of the way. We built a strict status language: one color, one icon, one label, used identically across every surface.

## Result

The app launched with multi-currency settlement that feels instant, card controls that respond in under 100ms, and expense insights that categorize automatically with a one-tap correction loop. It holds a 4.9★ App Store rating with compliance at PCI-DSS Level 1.
